{"user": "how do I play", "user_ts": "2026-08-26T14:31:45.490916+00:00", "assistant": "Place a Black disc on one of the pale-dot legal squares: **g2, b6, a7, b7, b8, or c8**. Any White discs trapped in a straight line between your new disc and another Black disc flip to Black.\n\nFor this endgame, don\u2019t just pick the move that flips most now. Ask:\n\n- Does my move give White a corner next turn?\n- Does it leave White with very few legal moves or a pass?\n- What will the final disc count look like after the last 10 empties?\n\nIf you want, name 1\u20132 moves you\u2019re considering and I\u2019ll help compare them.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-26T14:31:53.303104+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-26T14:31:54.853821+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 2, "Prompt": 3, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General Principle": 0.6666666666666666, "Prompt": 1.0, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Prompt"], "llama": ["Board Report", "Hint", "Prompt"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Direct Instruction", "Prompt"]}}
